<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"/><meta name="description" content="Contact Go2Abroad for clear, responsible guidance on your global education journey."/><title>Contact Us | Go2Abroad</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/globals.css"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/animations.css"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/page.css"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/content-pages.css"/></head><body class="contact-page"><div class="site-shell"><?php $basePath = ''; include_once __DIR__ . '/header.php'; ?><main><section class="contact-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow light">LET’S START WITH A CONVERSATION</p><h1>Bring us your<br/><em>big maybe.</em></h1><p>Tell us where you want to go, what you’re considering and what feels unclear. We’ll help you find the next responsible step.</p></div><div class="contact-hero-card"><span>RESPONSE PROMISE</span><strong>Clear guidance.<br/>One working day.</strong><small>We’ll review your message and connect you with the right person.</small></div></section><section class="contact-section content-container"><div class="contact-details"><p class="eyebrow">SAY HELLO</p><h2>Let’s make the<br/><em>next step clear.</em></h2><p>Whether you are just exploring or already preparing an application, we’re ready to listen.</p><div class="contact-detail-list"><a href="mailto:info@go2abroad.co"><span>EMAIL</span><strong>info@go2abroad.co</strong></a><a href="https://wa.me/0000000000"><span>WHATSAPP</span><strong>Chat with our team ↗</strong></a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/go2abroad_"><span>INSTAGRAM</span><strong>@go2abroad_ ↗</strong></a></div></div><form class="contact-form" id="contactForm"><div class="contact-form-heading"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR DETAILS</p><h3>Tell us a little<br/><em>about your plan.</em></h3></div><label>Full name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required placeholder="e.g. Priya Sharma"/></label><label>Email address<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@example.com"/></label><label>Phone number<input type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" required placeholder="+91 98765 43210"/></label><div class="contact-form-row"><label>Interested in<select name="interest" required><option value="" selected disabled>Choose a service</option><option>Core counselling</option><option>Applications &amp; visa</option><option>Student support</option><option>Career ecosystem</option></select></label><label>Preferred destination<select name="destination"><option>Not sure yet</option><option>United Kingdom</option><option>Australia</option><option>Canada</option><option>United States</option></select></label></div><label>Your message<textarea name="message" rows="4" placeholder="What would you like help with?"></textarea></label><button class="button button-dark" type="submit">Send my enquiry →</button><p class="contact-status" id="contactStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><small class="contact-note">Your details will only be used to respond to your enquiry.</small></form></section><section class="contact-cta"><p class="eyebrow light">NO PRESSURE · JUST CLARITY</p><h2>Not ready to fill a form?</h2><a class="button button-accent" href="mailto:info@go2abroad.co">Email us directly ↗</a></section></main><?php $basePath = ''; include_once __DIR__ . '/footer.php'; ?></div><script>const b=document.getElementById('menuButton'),n=document.getElementById('mobileNav');b.addEventListener('click',()=>{const o=n.classList.toggle('is-open');b.setAttribute('aria-expanded',o);b.textContent=o?'×':'☰'});document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit',event=>{event.preventDefault();const form=event.currentTarget;if(!form.checkValidity()){form.reportValidity();return}const data=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form));const subject=encodeURIComponent(`New enquiry from ${data.name}`);const body=encodeURIComponent(`Name: ${data.name}\nEmail: ${data.email}\nPhone: ${data.phone}\nInterested in: ${data.interest}\nDestination: ${data.destination}\nMessage: ${data.message}`);document.getElementById('contactStatus').textContent='Your enquiry is ready to send to our team.';window.location.href=`mailto:info@go2abroad.co?subject=${subject}&body=${body}`;form.reset();});</script>
</body></html>


